OL,3,CMonth of free bus travel for children
OL,4,Cin England starts
OL,6,FA month of free bus travel for
OL,7,Fchildren in England has started.
OL,9,FMost under-16s will not be required to
OL,10,Fpay for travel on most local buses
OL,11,Fthroughout August, the Department for
OL,12,FTransport (DfT) said.
OL,14,FThis is aimed at easing cost-of-living
OL,15,Fpressures on families during the
OL,16,Fschool summer holidays.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
