OL,3,CMonth of free bus travel for children
OL,4,Cin England starts
OL,6,FThe DfT identified several popular
OL,7,Fsites which can be visited using free
OL,8,Fbus travel for children, such as York
OL,9,FDungeon, Windsor Castle and the
OL,10,FNational Space Centre in Leicester.
OL,12,FBus fares usually cost #1-#2 for
OL,13,Fchildren aged five to 15.
OL,15,FBus travel is free for children under
OL,16,Ffive.
