OL,3,CMonth of free bus travel for children
OL,4,Cin England starts
OL,6,FLast week, the government announced it
OL,7,Fwill reintroduce a #2 cap on bus fares
OL,8,Ffor all passengers from the start of
OL,9,Fnext year.
OL,11,FThe current cap is #3.
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,14,Fsaid: "We're giving families room to
OL,15,Fbreathe from the cost-of-living
OL,16,Fsqueeze.
